# Task 15 — Windows interactive Scheduled Task installer
# 2026-08-22

Implementation:
- Added deploy/windows/install-wifimic-client.ps1.
- Canonical model is literal: C:\Program Files\wifimic-client, \wifimic\wifimic-client, firewall DisplayName wifimic-client, UDP 6902, and remote 192.168.0.210/32.
- The task XML is generated in memory and verified for LogonTrigger, Author/InteractiveToken, direct wifimic_client.exe execution, and absence of password/service credentials.
- Native operations are dependency-injected. TestMode and DryRun use an isolated fake state root and never call Scheduled Task, firewall, or canonical file APIs.
- The transaction captures prior task/firewall/executable state before mutation and restores or removes every changed artifact after a failure.

